<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-011" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong" source-id="s-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong-ws2180632">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">建元二年，有司奏，郊廟雅樂歌辭舊使學士博士撰，搜簡採用，請敕外，凡肄學者普令制立。參議：太廟登歌宜用司徒<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p001:m0052" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">褚淵</persName>，餘悉用黃門郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p001:m0061" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">謝超宗</persName>辭。<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p001:m0066" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">超宗</persName>所撰，多刪<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p001:m0073" ref="ftg_rxy_day">顏延之</persName>、<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p001:m0077" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABA">謝莊</persName>辭以爲新曲，備改樂名。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">建元初，詔黃門郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p002:m0008" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">謝超宗</persName>造明堂夕牲等辭，並採用<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p002:m0022" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABA">莊</persName>辭。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">昇明中，太祖爲齊王，令司空<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p003:m0013" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">褚淵</persName>造太廟登歌二章。建元初，詔黃門侍郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-011-xiechaozong:p003:m0032" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">謝超宗</persName>造廟樂歌詩十六章。</p>
</text>
